				{
					"name": "The Hitman and the Seer",
					"objectName": "ApheliosP",
					"image": "assets/characters/aphelios/hud/icons2d/apheliosp.png",
					"tooltip": "Aphelios wields 5 Lunari Weapons made by his sister, Alune. He has access to two at a time: one main-hand and one off-hand. Each weapon has a unique Attack and Ability [@spell.ApheliosCalibrumQ:Hotkey@]. Attacks and Abilities consume a weapon's ammo. When out of ammo, Aphelios discards the weapon and Alune summons the next one. <br><br>Aphelios unlocks his weapon's Ability [@spell.ApheliosCalibrumQ:Hotkey@] at level 2 and his Ultimate at level 6. Instead of powering up his Abilities, Aphelios' rank-ups grant him permanent stats.<br><br><passive>Lunari Weapon Order:</passive><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f1@ }}</li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f2@ }}</li><font color='#424242'><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f3@ }}</li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f4@ }}</li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f5@ }}</li></font>",
					"tooltipExtended": "Aphelios wields 5 Lunari Weapons made by his sister Alune. He has access to two at a time: one main-hand and one off-hand. Each weapon has a unique Attack and Ability [@spell.ApheliosCalibrumQ:Hotkey@]. Attacks and Abilities consume a weapon's ammo. When out of ammo, Aphelios discards the weapon and Alune summons the next one. <br><br>Aphelios unlocks his weapon's Ability [@spell.ApheliosCalibrumQ:Hotkey@] at level 2 and his Ultimate at level 6. Instead of powering up his Abilities, Aphelios' rank-ups grant him permanent stats:<li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_Buff_AD }} [@spell.ApheliosCalibrumQ:Hotkey@]: <physicalDamage>@spell.ApheliosP:AttackDamage@ / @AttackDamageMax@</physicalDamage></li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_Buff_AS }} [@spell.ApheliosW:Hotkey@]: <attackSpeed>@spell.ApheliosP:AttackSpeed@ / @AttackSpeedMax@</attackSpeed></li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_Buff_AP }} [@spell.ApheliosE:Hotkey@]: <scaleLethality>@spell.ApheliosP:ArPenBonus@ / @ArPenBonusMax@</scaleLethality></li><br><br><passive>Lunari Weapon Order:</passive><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f1@ }}</li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f2@ }}</li><font color='#424242'><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f3@ }}</li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f4@ }}</li><li>{{ Spell_ApheliosP_GunShortDesc_@f5@ }}</li></font>",
